{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022a.q12.material.recovered", "text": "平行线的判定根据平行线的定义，如果平面内的两条直线不相交，就可以判断这两条直线平行但是，由于直线无限延伸，检验它们是否相交有困难，所以难以直接根据定义来判断两条直线是否平行，那么，有没有其他判定方法呢？思考：我们以前已学过用直尺和三角尺画平行线(图5.2-5) ，在这一过程中，三角尺起着什么样的作用？简化图5.2-5得到图5.2-6，可以看出，画直线的平行线，实际上就是过点P画与相等的，而和正是直线、被直线截得的同位角，这说明，如果同位角相等，那么。一般地，有如下利用同位角判定两条直线平行的方法：判定方法1两条直线被第三条直线所截，如果同位角相等，那么这两条直线平行。简单说成：同位角相等，两直线平行。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "4601bb1423465eaa97e563a16302cea4e3ef86a6e5ad08fa77fcdd1d7f789210", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1123, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1427, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "4601bb1423465eaa97e563a16302cea4e3ef86a6e5ad08fa77fcdd1d7f789210"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022a.q12"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.304.r011", "ntce.outline.304.r015", "ntce.outline.304.r017", "ntce.outline.304.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2022a.q12"], "word_count": 304, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "4601bb1423465eaa97e563a16302cea4e3ef86a6e5ad08fa77fcdd1d7f789210", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1123, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1427, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_s